    "<div style='text-align:Left;'><p><span style='font-size:12pt;'>This dataset provides information regarding streetlight that have been installed within the Town of Whitby that are owned by the Town of Whitby. Streetlights owned by the Town of Whitby are along Town of Whitby streets and various other locations. Streetlights on Regional and Provincial roads are not owned by the Town of Whitby. Town of Whitby streetlight locations and information are provided by Elexicon.&nbsp;</span></p><p><a style='font-size:12pt;' target='_blank' href='https://whitby.maps.arcgis.com:443/sharing/rest/content/items/dfbaf3cb07974137b20744d2d8f0b70f/data' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><u>Click here for additional metadata</u></a>.&nbsp;</p><p><span style='font-size:16px;'>Updated December 2025.</span></p></div>"
